  first | exact @GlobalTheory.IsNef.isPsEff_pull_red_of_dim_le | exact GlobalTheory.IsNef.isPsEff_pull_red_of_dim_le | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.IsNef.isPsEff_pull_red_of_dim_le <;> assumption)
